<title>USA: Cavalier Homes pres/CEO/founder dies.</title>
<headline>Cavalier Homes pres/CEO/founder dies.</headline>
<dateline>WICHITA FALLS, Texas 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cavalier Homes Inc said Wednesday that its President and Chief Executive Jerry Wilson died Tuesday night of a heart attack.</p>
<p>Wilson, 57, founded the company in 1984 and served continuously as president and chief executive since then.</p>
<p>The company said its board of directors will meet &quot;in the near future&quot; to review and discuss management, operational and other issues.</p>
<p>Cavalier Homes produces manufactures homes and markets them through independent dealers in the southeast, southwest and midwest regions of the United States.</p>
</text>
